      "content": "hey, i woke up this morning and my face feels kinda weird on the left side. like my mouth is drooping a bit and i cant really close my left eye all the way. has this ever happened to you or do u know what it might be? is it just like bells palsy or something? i'm kinda worried it might be a stroke but i dont have any other symptoms really, just the face thing.",
